APP DISCLAIMER

Prompt Guide Studio / AI Rules Modern 2026 Generator is a development and prompt-engineering application for creating, reviewing and structuring prompts, manifests, exports and project-related working contexts. The application can generate helper data, suggestions, ZIP exports and textual instructions, but it does not replace independent professional, legal, security or production review.

All generated content must be checked by the user before use, publication or execution. External links, including GitHub and PayPal links, open in the browser. Donations are voluntary, go exclusively to Eric Heidrich / Nrwx, do not unlock additional rights and are not required for using the application.

